 "words": 218,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "An expert in the law stood up",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To test him in the crowd",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Teacher, what must I do to live",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He asked the question loud",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Love God with all your heart and soul",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your neighbor as yourself",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But who then is my neighbor, sir",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He asked, to clear himself",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Who is my neighbor",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who will stop along the road",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The one who showed him mercy",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Go and do likewise",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Go and do likewise",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "A man went down to Jericho",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And robbers struck him down",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They stripped him and they beat him there",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And left him on the ground",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A priest came by and saw him lie",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And passed the other side",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A Levite came and did the same",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And left him there to die",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But a Samaritan drew near",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And saw him where he lay",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he was moved with compassion",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He would not turn away",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He bound his wounds with oil and wine",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He set him on his own",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And brought him to an inn and stayed",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And did not leave him alone",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who is my neighbor",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who will stop along the road",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The one who showed him mercy",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Go and do likewise",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Go and do likewise",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Take care of him",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And whatever more you spend",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will repay you when I return",
